  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Unlike a dead land, Undying Kingdom blessed land is full of life, with birdsong and fragrant flowers.",
      "chapters": [
        906
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shark Demon brings Fang Yuan to Eastern Sea Zombie Alliance headquarters after the shark fishing banquet. The alliance holds a public blessed land at the center of yellow spring sea area, known among Eastern Sea Gu Immortals as Undying Kingdom, in contrast to Northern Plains Zombie Alliance’s Dark Flow Giant City. Under Shark Demon’s guidance Fang Yuan enters that blessed land smoothly.",
      "chapters": [
        906
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shark_demon",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "fac_zombie_alliance",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "loc_dark_flow_giant_city"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Most of the land still comes from immortal zombies, especially old Gu Immortals preparing to turn into immortal zombies. The name Undying Kingdom comes from Eastern Sea Zombie Alliance methods that merge pieces of blessed lands to preserve vitality. The alliance also researches how to keep an immortal aperture vital without changing an immortal zombie body, with incomplete but notable success. Shark Demon later brings Fang Yuan to the center of Undying Kingdom, where Fang Yuan receives an identity token and information path mortal Gu used for alliance messages, and joins Zombie Alliance.",
      "chapters": [
        906
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_information_path_mortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Undying Kingdom remains the named headquarters tied to yellow spring sea area as Fang Yuan’s Eastern Sea Zombie Alliance identity takes hold.",
      "chapters": [
        907
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
